(1. FINANCIAL PERFORMANCE & OPERATIONAL OVERVIEW) '
(Fiscal Year 2025-2026 was a year of landmark operational transformation for Apex Glob) '
(al Enterprise Solutions. ) '
(Total consolidated revenue for FY 2025-2026 reached $28.45 billion, representing an 8) '
(.2% Year-over-Year \(YoY\) growth in constant currency terms \(up from $26.30 billion) '
( in FY 2024-2025\). ) '
() '
(- **Operating Margin**: Expanded by 60 basis points to 24.8%, driven by enhanced deli) '
(very efficiencies and internal automation programs.) '
(- **Net Income**: Reached $6.12 billion, an increase of 9.4% YoY.) '
(- **Earnings Per Share \(EPS\)**: Increased to $4.25, compared to $3.88 in the prior ) '
(fiscal year.) '
(- **Operating Cash Flow**: Strong cash conversion at 104% of Net Income, totaling $6.) '
(36 billion.) '
(- **Free Cash Flow**: Reached $5.82 billion, allowing the board to approve a record d) '
(ividend payout of $2.40 per share and a $1.5 billion share repurchase program.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
