(2. SEGMENT & REGIONAL PERFORMANCE) '
(Growth was broad-based across all major industry verticals:) '
(- **Banking, Financial Services & Insurance \(BFSI\)**: Contributed $8.95 billion \(3) '
(1.5% of total revenue\), growing at 6.8% YoY driven by core banking modernization and) '
( real-time fraud mitigation architectures.) '
(- **Healthcare & Life Sciences**: Surged 14.2% YoY to $3.70 billion, fueled by clinic) '
(al trial data platforms and regulatory compliance infrastructure.) '
(- **Manufacturing & Energy**: Contributed $4.80 billion, up 7.5% YoY as smart factory) '
( solutions and predictive maintenance contracts accelerated.) '
(- **Retail & Consumer Goods**: Generated $4.20 billion, up 5.1% YoY.) '
(- **Digital Transformation & Cloud Services**: Grew 18.5% across all verticals, now a) '
(ccounting for 42.0% of total revenue.) '
() '
(**Geographic Breakdown**:) '
(- North America: 51.0% of revenues, growing 5.8% YoY.) '
(- Continental Europe & UK: 31.5% of revenues, growing 7.2% YoY.) '
(- Asia-Pacific & Emerging Markets: 17.5% of revenues, expanding rapidly at 16.4% YoY.) '
ET
