(3. STRATEGIC HIGHLIGHTS & CAPEX INVESTMENTS) '
(- **AI & Automation Center of Excellence**: Apex invested $680 million in Research & ) '
(Development \(R&D\) and internal AI enablement. Over 125,000 employees were certified) '
( in enterprise GenAI workflows and autonomous agentic development.) '
(- **Major Deal Wins**: Total Contract Value \(TCV\) signed during the year reached an) '
( all-time high of $34.8 billion, with a book-to-bill ratio of 1.22. This includes two) '
( mega-deals exceeding $1.0 billion in financial cloud infrastructure migration.) '
(- **Talent & Retention**: Total employee headcount stood at 215,400 with voluntary at) '
(trition declining to a multi-year low of 10.8% \(down from 14.1% in FY 2024-2025\).) '
ET
