(4. RISK FACTORS & VULNERABILITIES \(MD&A DISCLOSURE\)) '
(Management identified several critical risk categories in the Management Discussion a) '
(nd Analysis \(MD&A\) section:) '
(- **Client Discretionary Spend & Macroeconomic Headwinds**: High interest rate volati) '
(lity and cautious enterprise budgeting in North America and Western Europe could dela) '
(y multi-phase digital transformations.) '
(- **Geopolitical & Foreign Exchange Risks**: With over 45% of delivery operations in ) '
(overseas offshore hubs, fluctuations in USD/EUR/GBP/INR currency pairs may impact ope) '
(rating margins. Foreign exchange hedging covered 70% of projected net exposures.) '
(- **Cybersecurity & Data Privacy Compliance**: Heightened regulatory mandates \(EU AI) '
( Act, GDPR, SEC Cybersecurity Disclosure Rules\) require increased governance and sec) '
(urity audits. Any data breach could result in severe reputational damage and regulato) '
(ry fines.) '
(- **Talent Wage Inflation & Tech Shifts**: Rapid shifts in generative AI toolchains r) '
(equire continuous workforce reskilling. Failure to train personnel in agentic automat) '
(ion and cloud-native frameworks could impair project delivery margins.) '
ET
endstream
